The '''Thondroril River''' makes up the border between the [[Western Plaguelands|Western]] and [[Eastern Plaguelands]]. It runs from near the [[Terrorweb Tunnel]] to the north and empties out into [[Darrowmere Lake]] to the south. Along the river on on both sides, you can find [[maggot]]s, [[Vampire Bat|vampire bat]]s, [[plaguebear]]s and [[spider]]s. You can also find [[Tirion Fordring]] (a level 61 elite quest giver) near a ruined farmhouse on the Eastern Plaguelands side of the river.

